  "file": "README.md",
  "title": "LeanExe",
  "excerpt": "LeanExe compiles functions written in a restricted dialect of Lean to WebAssembly, C, AArch64 machine code, WGSL, PTX, and Thumb-2 machine code for the STM32F767ZI microcontroller, an Arm Cortex-M7, on ST's NUCLEO-F767ZI development board, and proves in Lean that the compiled code computes those functions."
 },
